<title>SINGAPORE: Cycle &amp; Carriage '96 net profit up 10pct.</title>
<headline>Cycle &amp; Carriage '96 net profit up 10pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>( in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   200.1  vs  181.6</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	85.7  vs   77.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	    27.0  vs   24.0</p>
<p>    Turnover (bln)		 3.0  vs    2.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   205.7  vs  236.1</p>
<p>    Associates		   104.1  vs   54.8</p>
<p>    Pretax			 310.3  vs  287.1</p>
<p>    Tax			     86.6  vs   84.3</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (23.6) vs  (21.2)</p>
<p>Note- Cycle &amp; Carriage Ltd is a diversified motor distributor with interests in property development.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
